'''Mt. Shady''' <!--(Japanese: '''<kanji>''' ''<direct translation>'')--> is an {{pkmn|animated series}}-exclusive location in the [[Sinnoh]] [[region]], found near [[Lilypad Town]]. It appeared in ''[[DP145|A Rivalry to Gible On!]]''.
[[File:Mount Shady Grassy Area.png|thumb|left|220px|The grassy areas of Mt. Shady]]          
Mt. Shady is known for a {{pkmn2|wild}} {{p|Gible}} who had a habit of taking out the Pokémon of just about any Trainer who attempted to catch it. The Gible used both Mt. Shady's grassy areas as well as its system of caverns in its attempts to evade being {{pkmn2|caught}}. {{Ash}}'s companion [[Khoury]] eventually caught the Gible. There is also a lake where {{TRT}} were after Gible, but they were blasted off by a {{p|Sharpedo}}. 
